fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gststructure.html#gst_structure_id_str_get_field_type","fragment":"\n\tgst_structure_id_str_get_field_type\n\n\n\tGst.Structure.prototype.id_str_get_field_type\n\n\n\tGst.Structure.id_str_get_field_type\n\nFinds the field with the given name, and returns the type of the\nvalue it contains.  If the field is not found, G_TYPE_INVALID is\nreturned.\nParameters:\na GstStructure\nthe name of the field\nthe GValue of the field\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nFinds the field with the given name, and returns the type of the\nvalue it contains.  If the field is not found, G_TYPE_INVALID is\nreturned.\nParameters:\na Gst.Structure\nthe name of the field\nthe GObject.Value of the field\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nFinds the field with the given name, and returns the type of the\nvalue it contains.  If the field is not found, G_TYPE_INVALID is\nreturned.\nParameters:\na Gst.Structure\nthe name of the field\nthe GObject.Value of the field\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});